#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
NORA Entity-Context 4.1.1
========================

Offline pipeline for interaction-level semantic structuring and discovery.

Primary responsibilities
------------------------
- privacy-safe preprocessing and grouped development / locked-test boundaries
- corpus-trained stopword and template suppression
- duplicate-family-aware phrase protection and domain-signal rescue
- entity, context, key-value, evidence, cause, remediation and relationship extraction
- optional local ontology enrichment from lexicon or RDF-family files
- hybrid TF-IDF + SVD representation
- density clustering with validation-only policy/model selection
- semantic coherence, stability and locked-test quality diagnostics
- JSON / JSONL dictionary output, CSV audits, HTML and PNG diagnostics
- persisted inference bundle and reproducibility manifest

Boundary
--------
Existing upstream labels are metadata only. They are never used as training
features or as cluster-selection targets. The locked-test partition is not
used for stopword learning, phrase learning, policy selection, clustering
parameter selection or model fitting.

Runtime
-------
No hosted API, external LLM or model download is required.
"""

